  (e.g., nim c --app:lib --out:imhist_nim.so --noMain --passC:"-fPIC" imhist_nim.nim  — exact compile flags depend on platform).
- The Python code expects the module to be importable as imhist_nim and to provide a function histogram(pixels, bins) returning a sequence/list of ints.

