- Dict of lists: process_json_minmax_plot('{"a":[1,2,3],"b":[2,4,6]}', output_path='out.png')
- List of dicts: process_json_minmax_plot('[{"x":1,"y":10},{"x":2,"y":15},{"x":3,"y":20}]')

